IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ito-il30-nouns`

-- Income Tax Ordinance [New Version], s 8(c): spreading of certain income over several tax years, at the request of the taxpayer or the heirs.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are copied mechanically from line N of
-- ../../registers/source-bundle/income-tax-ordinance-new-version.he.wiki.txt (sha256 b87f2cf4...6b81b6).
--
-- WHAT IT SAYS. At the request of the assessee or the heirs, for computing the tax on them, the following incomes are regarded as received as stated:
-- (1) wage differences or annuity differences, in the years to which they relate, but not more than six tax years ending in the year received;
-- (2) vacation redemption pay of an employee, in equal annual parts within a period of not more than six tax years ending in the year received,
-- but not more than the years of his work; (3) personal-exertion income of paragraphs (5) or (6) of the s 1 definition (a retirement or death
-- grant, a commutation of an annuity), in equal annual parts in the working years for which the grant is paid or the period in which the annuity
-- right arose, but not more than the six tax years ending in the year the grant or the commutation was received; the Director may, if asked, allow
-- another period, including future years, on conditions including an advance.
--
-- WHAT THE ENCODING RETURNS: where each part of the income is regarded as received (a list of tax years with amounts). The tax on the parts is that of
-- s 121 (row IL-03), year by year; this section does not compute it.
--
-- NOT ENCODED: (a) and (b) (the Director's permission for premiums and for patents: discretion, no rule); (d) (the death of the assessee or the
-- winding-up of the company within a period the Director allowed: it adds the rest of the income to the year of death; the Director's period is an input
-- and the adding up is arithmetic, see NOTES.md coverage).
--
-- FORKS: E1 (an older difference) and E2 (working years outside the six tax years). Each declines by default where the readings give different answers.

§ `Section 8(c) — spreading`

-- src:531 | סעיף 8 – חלוקת הכנסה ליותר משנה אחת [תיקון: תשל״ז, תשס״ה־4, תשע״ב־5, תשע״ז־20]
-- src:532 | (א) המנהל רשאי להתיר שדמי מפתח או פרמיה לפי סעיף 2(6), שהיא דמי השתתפות בהוצאות בנין, או תשלום בדומה לכך, יחולקו בתור הכנסה לכל תקופת חוזה השכירות או לכל תקופה אחרת שיקבענה המנהל.
-- src:533 | (ב) הכנסה ממכירת פטנט, מדגָם או עיצוב על ידי הממציא או ממכירת זכות־יוצרים על ידי היוצרים, רשאי המנהל להתיר חלוקתה לתקופה שיקבע המנהל; הוראה זו לא תחול על הכנסה לפי סעיף 2(9).
-- src:534 | (ג) לפי בקשת הנישום או יורשיו, יראו את ההכנסות שלהלן, לענין חישוב סכום המס החל עליהן, כאילו נתקבלו כאמור לצידן:
-- src:535 | (1) הפרשי שכר או הפרשי קצבה – בשנים שאליהן הם מתייחסים, אך לא יותר משש שנות מס המסתיימות בשנה שבה נתקבלו; לעניין זה, ”קצבה“ – קצבה המשתלמת מכוח הסדר פנסיה תקציבית כהגדרתו בסעיף 9(6ו), וכן קצבה כאמור בפסקאות (2) עד (3א) להגדרה ”הכנסה מיגיעה אישית“ שבסעיף 1.
-- src:536 | (2) דמי פדיון חופשה שקיבל עובד – בחלקים שנתיים שווים תוך תקופה שאינה עולה על שש שנות מס המסתיימות בשנה שבה נתקבלו, אך לא יותר משנות עבודתו;
-- src:537 | (3) הכנסה מיגיעה אישית כאמור בפסקאות (5) או (6) להגדרתה שבסעיף 1 – בחלקים שנתיים שווים בשנות העבודה שבשלהן משולם המענק או בתקופה שבה נוצרה הזכות לקיצבה, לפי הענין, אך בלא יותר משש שנות המס המסתיימות בשנה שבה נתקבלו המענק או היוון הקיצבה; אולם רשאי המנהל, אם נתבקש על כך, להתיר חלוקה לתקופה אחרת לרבות לשנים הבאות, בתנאים שיקבע, לרבות תשלום מקדמה.
-- src:538 | (ד) התיר המנהל לפי סעיף זה או לפי סעיף 9א(ד) חלוקתה של הכנסה ומת הנישום, או שהוחל בפירוקה של החברה הנישומה, לפני תום התקופה שקבע המנהל, תיווסף להכנסת הנישום בשנת המס שבה מת, או להכנסת החברה בשנת המס שבה הוחל בפירוקה, כל ההכנסה העולה לפי אותה חלוקה בחלקן של השנים שלאחר אותה שנת מס; אולם לפי בקשתם של יורשי הנישום, מנהל עזבונו או המוציא לפועל של צוואתו, תחולק כל ההכנסה כולה חלוקה חדשה לתקופת השנים שנסתיימה בשנת המס שבה מת הנישום או, לפי בקשתם של יורשי הנישום, תיחשב כל ההכנסה העולה לפי אותה חלוקה בחלקן של השנים שלאחר אותה שנת מס כהכנסתם של יורשי הנישום בשנים אלה, לפי שיעור חלקיהם בעזבון הנישום, לאחר שנתנו ערובה, להנחת דעתו של המנהל, לתשלום המס שיגיע מהם לפי חישוב זה; ובלבד שאם שילם כדין מקדמה על פי סעיף קטן (ג)(3) או סעיף 9א(ד) או אם נוכה מס במקור לפי סעיף 164 – יראו את סכום המקדמה ששולם או את סכום המס שנוכה, כאמור, המתייחסים לשנים שלאחר הפטירה, כסכום המס המגיע.

GIVETH A LIST OF `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`section 8(c) applies only at the request of the assessee or the heirs` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 8(c) regards the income as received in other years only at the request of the assessee or the heirs"

GIVETH A LIST OF `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`section 8(c)(1) does not say where a difference older than six tax years is placed, and here the place changes the answer` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 8(c)(1) does not say where a difference older than the six tax years is placed, and here the place changes the answer"

GIVETH A LIST OF `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`section 8(c)(2) lets the employee choose at most six tax years and at most the years of the employee's work` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 8(c)(2) lets the period run for at most six tax years ending in the year of receipt and at most the years of the employee's work, and here the number chosen is outside that"

GIVETH A LIST OF `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`section 8(c)(3) has no working years to spread the grant over` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 8(c)(3) spreads the grant over the working years it is paid for, and none was given that falls where the section reaches"

GIVETH A LIST OF `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`section 8(c)(3) does not say which working years count when they end before the year of receipt, and here it changes the answer` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 8(c)(3) does not say which working years count when they end before the year of receipt, and here it changes the answer"

GIVETH A LIST OF `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`a period the Director allowed must be given as tax years` MEANS
    REFUSE "the period the Director allowed under section 8(c)(3) was given as no tax year"

-- A share.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`a share in the tax year` y `of` a MEANS
    `A share of an amount placed in one tax year` WITH
        `the tax year` IS y
        `the amount`   IS a

-- Equal annual parts: the amount divided by the years, one share for each year.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 8(c)(2), (3) (source lines 536-537)
GIVEN a     IS A NUMBER
      years IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`the amount` a `in equal annual parts in the tax years` years MEANS
    map (GIVEN y YIELD `a share in the tax year` y `of` (a DIVIDED BY count years)) years

-- The six tax years ending in the year of receipt, earliest first.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the six tax years ending in` y MEANS
    LIST y MINUS 5, y MINUS 4, y MINUS 3, y MINUS 2, y MINUS 1, y

-- (1): each difference in the year it relates to; one older than the six tax years, or later than the year of receipt, as fork E1 says.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 8(c)(1) (source line 535); fork E1
GIVEN d IS A `A difference of wages or of an annuity`
      y IS A NUMBER
      r IS A `A reading of differences that relate to years before the six tax years`
GIVETH A `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`the place of the difference` d `received in` y `, reading an older difference as` r MEANS
    IF   d's `the tax year the difference relates to` AT LEAST y MINUS 5
    THEN `a share in the tax year` (d's `the tax year the difference relates to`) `of` (d's `the amount of the difference`)
    ELSE CONSIDER r
         WHEN `an older difference is placed in the year of receipt`                  THEN `a share in the tax year` y `of` (d's `the amount of the difference`)
         WHEN `an older difference is placed in the earliest of the six tax years`    THEN `a share in the tax year` (y MINUS 5) `of` (d's `the amount of the difference`)
         WHEN `declined where the place of an older difference changes the answer`    THEN `a share in the tax year` y `of` (d's `the amount of the difference`)

GIVEN d IS A `A difference of wages or of an annuity`
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the difference` d `received in` y `is older than the six tax years` MEANS
    d's `the tax year the difference relates to` LESS THAN y MINUS 5

-- The working years that count under (3) at a reading of fork E2.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 8(c)(3) (source line 537); fork E2
GIVEN years IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      y     IS A NUMBER
      r     IS A `A reading of working years outside the six tax years`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the working years` years `that count, for a receipt in` y `, reading them as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `only the working years inside the six tax years count`   THEN `inside the six`
    WHEN `the last six working years count, wherever they fall`    THEN `the last six`
    WHEN `declined where the working years outside the six tax years change the answer`  THEN `inside the six`
    WHERE
        `inside the six` MEANS filter (GIVEN w YIELD w AT LEAST y MINUS 5 AND w AT MOST y) years
        `the last six` MEANS drop (max 0 (count years MINUS 6)) years

-- The income spread: the allocation, or a refusal.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 8(c) (source lines 534-537); forks E1, E2; Meng's ruling of 2026-10-08 (SHRUG)
GIVEN `the income`       IS A `Income to be spread under section 8(c)`
      `the year`         IS A NUMBER
      `a request was made` IS A BOOLEAN
      e1                 IS A `A reading of differences that relate to years before the six tax years`
      e2                 IS A `A reading of working years outside the six tax years`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A share of an amount placed in one tax year`
`s 8(c) — where is regarded as received` `the income` `received in` `the year` `at a request:` `a request was made` `, reading an older difference as` e1 `and working years outside the six as` e2 MEANS
    IF   NOT `a request was made`
    THEN `section 8(c) applies only at the request of the assessee or the heirs`
    ELSE CONSIDER `the income`
         WHEN `wage differences or annuity differences` `the differences`
           THEN IF   e1 EQUALS `declined where the place of an older difference changes the answer` AND any (GIVEN d YIELD `the difference` d `received in` `the year` `is older than the six tax years`) `the differences`
                THEN `section 8(c)(1) does not say where a difference older than six tax years is placed, and here the place changes the answer`
                ELSE map (GIVEN d YIELD `the place of the difference` d `received in` `the year` `, reading an older difference as` e1) `the differences`
         WHEN `vacation redemption pay received by an employee` `the amount of the vacation pay` `the number of tax years the requester chose` `the number of years of the employee's work`
           THEN IF   `the number of tax years the requester chose` LESS THAN 1 OR `the number of tax years the requester chose` GREATER THAN 6 OR `the number of tax years the requester chose` GREATER THAN `the number of years of the employee's work`
                THEN `section 8(c)(2) lets the employee choose at most six tax years and at most the years of the employee's work`
                ELSE `the amount` `the amount of the vacation pay` `in equal annual parts in the tax years` (drop (6 MINUS `the number of tax years the requester chose`) (`the six tax years ending in` `the year`))
         WHEN `a grant or a commutation of an annuity of paragraph (5) or (6) of the definition of income from personal exertion` `the amount of the grant or commutation` `the working years the grant is paid for, or the years in which the annuity right arose` `the years the Director allowed instead`
           THEN CONSIDER `the years the Director allowed instead`
                WHEN JUST allowed
                  THEN IF   null allowed
                       THEN `a period the Director allowed must be given as tax years`
                       ELSE `the amount` `the amount of the grant or commutation` `in equal annual parts in the tax years` allowed
                WHEN NOTHING
                  THEN IF   e2 EQUALS `declined where the working years outside the six tax years change the answer` AND NOT (`the working years` `the working years the grant is paid for, or the years in which the annuity right arose` `that count, for a receipt in` `the year` `, reading them as` `only the working years inside the six tax years count` EQUALS `the working years` `the working years the grant is paid for, or the years in which the annuity right arose` `that count, for a receipt in` `the year` `, reading them as` `the last six working years count, wherever they fall`)
                       THEN `section 8(c)(3) does not say which working years count when they end before the year of receipt, and here it changes the answer`
                       ELSE IF   null (`the working years` `the working years the grant is paid for, or the years in which the annuity right arose` `that count, for a receipt in` `the year` `, reading them as` e2)
                            THEN `section 8(c)(3) has no working years to spread the grant over`
                            ELSE `the amount` `the amount of the grant or commutation` `in equal annual parts in the tax years` (`the working years` `the working years the grant is paid for, or the years in which the annuity right arose` `that count, for a receipt in` `the year` `, reading them as` e2)
